            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "DiResta, R., Miller, C., Molter, V., Pomfret, J., and Tiffert, G. (2022). Telling China’s Story: The Chinese Communist Party’s Campaign to Shape Global Narratives. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/pf306sw8941. https://doi.org/10.25740/pf306sw8941.",
